category: Video
requires: cygwin libaravis0.8_0 libglib2.0_0 libgstinterfaces1.0_0 libgstreamer1.0_0 libgtk3_0 libintl8
sdesc: "Library for video acquisition using Genicam cameras (utilities)"
ldesc: "Aravis is a glib/gobject based library for video acquisition using Genicam
cameras. It currently only implements an ethernet camera protocol used for
industrial cameras."

